Senator Stewart-Cousins, from the Committee on Rules, reports the following bills:

Senate Print 172, by Senator Ramos, an act to amend the Workers' Compensation Law;

Senate Print 372, by Senator Gianaris, an act to amend the Labor Law;

Senate Print 1235A, by Senator Comrie, an act to amend the New York State Medical Care Facilities Finance Agency Act;

Senate Print 1514, by Senator Harckham, an act to amend the Labor Law;

Senate Print 2236, by Senator Gounardes, an act to amend the Labor Law;

Senate Print 4515, by Senator Ramos, an act to amend the Labor Law;

Senate Print 4587, by Senator Mayer, an act to amend the Education Law;

Senate Print 5442, by Senator Krueger, an act to amend the State Finance Law.

All bills reported direct to third reading.
